DESCRIPTION:🚧 Part of the line closed\n\nQueen's Park to Harrow & Weald
 stone\nDates as listed by TfL: Saturday 21 November to Sunday 22 November 
 2026\n\nTfL live status (Part Closure\, checked 22 November 2026): BAKERLO
 O LINE: Saturday 21 and Sunday 22 November\, no service between Queens Par
 k and Harrow & Wealdstone. Please note that special bus service 718 will N
 OT operate. There will also be no LIONESS LINE service between Euston and 
 Watford Junction. LONDON NORTH WESTERN RAILWAY trains continue to stop at 
 Harrow & Wealdstone. SOUTHERN trains stop at Wembley Central and Harrow & 
 Wealdstone until 1900 Saturday only\, not on Sunday.\n\nSource: TfL planne
 d track closures\, correct at Monday 16 November 2026. https://tfl.gov.uk/
 api/document/plannedtrackclosures.pdf?id=accc98cf-e761-47b3-a43b-3de08a097
 b8f&type=document\nPlans can change. Check before you travel: https://tfl.
